cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "InsectTrait: Colour, Pattern and Shape Traits of Insects from Photographs"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahimi
    given-names: Ehsan
  - family-names: Jung
    given-names: Chuleui
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehsanrahimi666/InsectTrait"
abstract: >-
  An R package with an optional Python back end that detects and outlines
  insects in field photographs, screens photos with a validated photo filter
  and computes colour, pattern and shape traits with a catalogue of their
  reliability. Validated for insects only.
